*.tmp
*.bak_*
# Operators date their backups with a hyphen as often as an underscore
# (.env.bak-pre-rotation-20260807, docker-compose.override.yml.bak-...-recordmode).
# Only the underscore form was ignored, so the hyphen form made every live
# deployment tree permanently dirty — which the #1766 build-revision preflight
# then (correctly) refuses to call a verified build.
*.bak-*
# Compose local overrides are per-deployment by convention and are never
# committed; on broker hosts they carry node-specific runtime settings.
docker-compose.override.yml
# A2A bridge scratch directory created next to the checkout at task time.
.a2a-bridge/
.DS_Store
handlers/

# OpenClaw runtime/bootstrap context files are local-only and must not enter PRs.
.openclaw/
AGENTS.md
SOUL.md
USER.md
TOOLS.md
HEARTBEAT.md
IDENTITY.md
